Transition Matrix
The transition matrix summarizes all state changes:
\[
\mathbf{P} = \begin{pmatrix}
1 - \pi_{j0} & \pi_{j0} \\
1 - \pi_{j1} & \pi_{j1}
\end{pmatrix}
\]
Row \(k\) gives probabilities of moving from state \(k\) to each possible state.

